    "name": "Ultranova",
    "steam_appid": 2384360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/f86609d6bacf7cffd22f3671cf870d3d.avif?t=1709772386\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/df0690eeb0f23c95ae6cf270590f58b9.poster.avif?t=1709772386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/df0690eeb0f23c95ae6cf270590f58b9.webm?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/df0690eeb0f23c95ae6cf270590f58b9.mp4?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Action-packed, sci-fi platformer where you play as Nova, a cyborg with extraordinary technological abilities. Immerse yourself in an exciting journey with beautiful retro-styled graphics, pristine polygons, and a nostalgic spacesynth soundtrack blending modern gameplay, graphics, music, and effects seamlessly together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/d9b9bb5847dd976f965464d21e70529a.poster.avif?t=1709772386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/d9b9bb5847dd976f965464d21e70529a.webm?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/d9b9bb5847dd976f965464d21e70529a.mp4?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become Nova, a courageous cyborg and a member of the &quot;Field Hunters&quot; on a resource-gathering mission for the depleted home planet, Ultragon. A normal everyday mission becomes a battle for survival when you crash-land on a Death Zone planet. Equipped with your blaster rifle, your wits, and unyielding determination, you gain new abilities and uncover well-hidden secrets as you fight your way through enemies and rough conditions searching for a way back home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master your skills</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/2fddb837895e2c73a4ecce9da34b5172.poster.avif?t=1709772386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/2fddb837895e2c73a4ecce9da34b5172.webm?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/2fddb837895e2c73a4ecce9da34b5172.mp4?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in Gripping Narrative: Immerse yourself in an enthralling story. Unveil the mysteries of the Death Zone planet through quirky locals you encounter on your way.<br></li><li>Explore a Dying World: Traverse the harsh landscapes of a planet in its death throes. Survive the extreme weather conditions, from desolate deserts to swamp-like forests and frozen mountains.<br></li><li>Fight to survive: Engage in intense battles learning the different abilities of your enemies and how to beat them.<br></li><li>Unleash Cyborg Abilities: Acquire powerful gear and augmentations throughout your journey. Collect tabs or complete side quests to enhance your abilities and gain new combat prowesses to overcome increasingly difficult challenges and enemies.<br></li><li>Climb on the Leaderboard: Compete against other players with intense one-player vs. the game system challenges. Earn achievements and rise to the top of the global leaderboards to showcase your talent.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/f86609d6bacf7cffd22f3671cf870d3d.avif?t=1709772386\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/df0690eeb0f23c95ae6cf270590f58b9.poster.avif?t=1709772386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/df0690eeb0f23c95ae6cf270590f58b9.webm?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/df0690eeb0f23c95ae6cf270590f58b9.mp4?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Action-packed, sci-fi platformer where you play as Nova, a cyborg with extraordinary technological abilities. Immerse yourself in an exciting journey with beautiful retro-styled graphics, pristine polygons, and a nostalgic spacesynth soundtrack blending modern gameplay, graphics, music, and effects seamlessly together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/d9b9bb5847dd976f965464d21e70529a.poster.avif?t=1709772386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/d9b9bb5847dd976f965464d21e70529a.webm?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/d9b9bb5847dd976f965464d21e70529a.mp4?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become Nova, a courageous cyborg and a member of the &quot;Field Hunters&quot; on a resource-gathering mission for the depleted home planet, Ultragon. A normal everyday mission becomes a battle for survival when you crash-land on a Death Zone planet. Equipped with your blaster rifle, your wits, and unyielding determination, you gain new abilities and uncover well-hidden secrets as you fight your way through enemies and rough conditions searching for a way back home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master your skills</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/2fddb837895e2c73a4ecce9da34b5172.poster.avif?t=1709772386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/2fddb837895e2c73a4ecce9da34b5172.webm?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384360/extras/2fddb837895e2c73a4ecce9da34b5172.mp4?t=1709772386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in Gripping Narrative: Immerse yourself in an enthralling story. Unveil the mysteries of the Death Zone planet through quirky locals you encounter on your way.<br></li><li>Explore a Dying World: Traverse the harsh landscapes of a planet in its death throes. Survive the extreme weather conditions, from desolate deserts to swamp-like forests and frozen mountains.<br></li><li>Fight to survive: Engage in intense battles learning the different abilities of your enemies and how to beat them.<br></li><li>Unleash Cyborg Abilities: Acquire powerful gear and augmentations throughout your journey. Collect tabs or complete side quests to enhance your abilities and gain new combat prowesses to overcome increasingly difficult challenges and enemies.<br></li><li>Climb on the Leaderboard: Compete against other players with intense one-player vs. the game system challenges. Earn achievements and rise to the top of the global leaderboards to showcase your talent.</li></ul>",
